Z||000005||JD86GT350||11-13-2001||09:54 PM||||thanks   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>the wheels on the '84 are some aftermarkets, the center caps used to say "Prime".  That's as much as I know about em.  I had the pockets painted, and the wheels polished and powdercoat cleared at the wheel plant associated with the parts store I manage (<A HREF="http://www.keystone-auto.com" TARGET=_blank>Keystone Automotive</A> is the building in the background).  Before somebody asks, that's a Z24 scoop on the hood   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><P>The GT is a real, real dark purple, about 40% of the folks who see it think its black, and its pretty dirty in that pic.||||reg||14
